LIMITS
Screen-off and forced-Doze results establish synthetic Android behavior under
the tested user-approved exemption, not indefinite physical Nikon reception.
Z6II capture compatibility, actual AP policy, throughput, long idle and OEM
process-kill behavior still need physical testing. Ordinary backgrounding and
screen lock do not intentionally stop the shared queue/session. Force-stop,
process termination and camera AP shutdown cannot be prevented by this app.

